  panels:
    panel_0 (inner tile mask): n x n binary mask, color 1, fill 50-80%, not all-filled
    panel_1 (outer layout mask): n x n binary mask, color 2, fill 50-70%, not all-filled
    panel_2 (foreground swatch): n x n solid block, any non-bg/non-sep color
